From 59fd70ad0c303da1a0faa1c5a4e2814ae77121e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:28:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add price in reais to events

Price is a DECIMAL(8,2) column. The model accepts comma or dot
(regex instead of FILTER_VALIDATE_FLOAT, which takes 1e3 and -1),
normalizes the comma to a dot before saving, and formats the value
as "R$ 10,50" or "Gratuito" when it is zero.
